    {
      "id": "claim_f45064cfdcb74f318aeb843b588882d0",
      "statement": "The same injectable on_task executor serves both trust modes: marketplace service_book bookings (HAAPServer._on_service_book with marketplace_policy.auto_accept enabled) create a task with role=\"server\", action=\"booking:reserve\" and resource set to the service, invoke on_task with the raw booking payload, merge the returned dict into the booking record, walk the task submitted -> accepted -> completed and reply a completed task_result with an MKT-prefixed task id, or mark the task failed and reply a TASK_ERROR error envelope when the callback raises.",
      "evidence": [
